=== Bank-account type-system demo ===

Alice: id=1 bal=50000c USD
Bob:   id=2 bal=30000c USD

After deposit: Alice bal = 62500c
After withdraw: Alice bal = 57500c
After transfer 100.00 USD A->B: Alice=47500c Bob=40000c

boundary 1 -- mixing currencies: currency mismatch: USD vs EUR
boundary 2 -- non-account arg: value not account
boundary 3 -- overdraft:     insufficient: 40000 < 99999999
boundary 4 -- float->int cents: 12

boundary 5 -- pinned-typed bindings: cents=0 acc=1

=== Audit log ===
  transfer: acc=1 amt=10000c USD
  withdraw: acc=1 amt=10000c USD
  withdraw: acc=1 amt=5000c USD

demo complete
